  "id": "stagnation",
  "term": "stagnation",
  "definition": "Stagnation is a state in which progress or action is held back, often because people see problems but avoid change and prefer familiar discomfort over uncertain outcomes. In social or scientific settings, it refers to development being stalled by resistance to disruption and the unknown.",
